{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0054_1000_028ari", "source_sha256": "c719ad53a1c3d3fc8919688b5ea4d41b5234f96d16d9fa75873bca5176483404", "ja": "ムフ、ムフフ……ムフフフフ……♪", "zh": "唔呼、唔呼呼……唔呼呼呼呼……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0054_1001_p", "source_sha256": "cf440986de14673e0b786edd45f79650f9f30450f637f58cf9d20db14bc5566b", "ja": "亜利沙、新しい衣装はどうだ？\n何か問題は……。", "zh": "亚利沙，新服装穿起来怎样？\n有没有问题……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
