{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0054_1008_028ari", "source_sha256": "76f6043eb3ac5c7e3154cf2c7255f89276c536aaaa31f910673a614c7e779b28", "ja": "そ、そうですよ！　ありさがそんな、勝手に他の\nアイドルちゃんの衣装を着たり……するはずが……。", "zh": "就、就是说啊！亚利沙怎么可能\n会偷穿其他……偶像宝贝的服装……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0054_1009_p", "source_sha256": "254839e64f9817c276764c21412d02a2e5beecf49ffe44fdb4bfacecd5ee8005", "ja": "ああ、いくら亜利沙でもそこまで……ん？\n亜利沙、どうして目を背けるんだ？", "zh": "对啊，就算是亚利沙也不会做这种事……嗯？\n亚利沙，你怎么不敢看我？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0054_1010_028ari", "source_sha256": "e1424d784aaf41de65bf8024003a3601177b1dc0484d46505b730ca92e4ef02c", "ja": "い、いえ……ありさを信じてくれる\n{$P$}さんの目が、まぶしくて……！", "zh": "不、不是……因为{$P$}先生，\n你信赖亚利沙的眼神，实在太刺眼了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0054_1011_028ari", "source_sha256": "4827b012951bd3a3394a8865a1830b0ac1e53c2b902e3515af0138cc887f3ad6", "ja": "あーやっぱりダメですごめんなさいありさ自首します！\nありさは、ありさはアイドルちゃんの衣装を……！", "zh": "啊──果然不该做这种事情对不起亚利沙要自首！\n亚利沙、亚利沙偷穿了其他偶像宝贝的服装……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
