{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0054_1016_028ari", "source_sha256": "3c1089c904db0e5e50d25feb313d898bc7f73859dc915458a9835f8cebe3e62c", "ja": "ほ、ホントですか？　ムフ、ムフフフフ……♪　\nありがとうございます、{$P$}さん！", "zh": "真、真的吗？唔呼、唔呼呼呼呼……♪\n谢谢你，{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
